  "body": "To download the documents for this property, copy and paste the following link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/CM6J\r\n\r\nFreshly renovated and ready to enjoy, this single level brick and tile home on highly sought after Chesterfield Way is one you won't want to miss.\r\n\r\nOffering three bedrooms, a semi-ensuite, separate guest toilet, internal-access garaging and additional off-street parking, it's a practical and easy-care home in one of Orewa's most popular pockets. Slightly elevated above the flat, it still keeps you close to everything that makes Orewa such a great place to live.\r\n\r\nOutside, the sunny north facing patio is the perfect spot for your morning coffee, afternoon drink or simply relaxing in the sun.\r\n\r\nWith Orewa town centre, the beach, cafes, shops and local amenities all within easy walking distance, the location is hard to beat. Homes in this part of Orewa are always tightly held and highly sought after.\r\n\r\nThis really is a golden opportunity and I don't expect it to last long.",
